  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Upload your conditional flowchart or outline. \r\n\r\n2. Ask AI to write pseudocode that makes the same decision and shows the result on the screen (use the element with the ID `output`).\r\n\r\n2. Write your JavaScript to fill in the logic:\r\n\r\n   * Define a variable or input.\r\n\r\n   * Use an `if/else` statement to make the decision.\r\n\r\n   * Update the output area on the screen to show the result.\r\n\r\n3. Test your code to make sure your code matches your flowchart. \r\n\r\n_Hint: Try storing different values in your variable(s) to test out different outcomes._",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "outline",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
